<section class="info-hero"><div class="container"><span class="section-kicker">Materials & Care</span><h1>Outdoor Furniture Materials and Care</h1><p>The material name alone is not enough. Treatment, construction, use and care all affect performance.</p></div></section><section class="container section-space info-page"><div class="materials-grid"><article><h2>Metal</h2><p>Review the coating and frame treatment for the selected model. Keep surfaces clean and address deep scratches early.</p><a href="{{ '/categories/metal-outdoor-furniture/' | localeUrl('en') | url }}">Browse Metal Furniture</a></article><article><h2>Metal and Wood</h2><p>This combination provides a stable frame with a natural wood appearance. Care depends on the wood type and treatment.</p><a href="{{ '/categories/metal-and-wood-outdoor-furniture/' | localeUrl('en') | url }}">Browse Metal and Wood</a></article><article><h2>Rattan and Outdoor Rope</h2><p>Modern woven designs. Review the inner frame, weave material and model-specific cleaning instructions.</p><a href="{{ '/categories/rattan-outdoor-furniture/' | localeUrl('en') | url }}">Rattan</a> · <a href="{{ '/categories/outdoor-rope-furniture/' | localeUrl('en') | url }}">Outdoor Rope</a></article><article><h2>Fabric and Upholstery</h2><p>Water and sun resistance vary by fabric. Follow cleaning instructions and store removable cushions during severe conditions when recommended.</p></article></div></section><section class="container info-alert"><i class="bi bi-info-circle"></i><div><h2>Review the Exact Model Specifications</h2><p>These are general guidelines. Ask Nestica for the selected product's material and care details before confirming.</p></div></section>
